<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS3" title="In Appendix C Prompts ‣ Breaking the Mirror: Activation-Based Mitigation of Self-Preference in LLM Evaluators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.3 </span>Prompt Intervention Baseline</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Breaking the Mirror: Activation-Based Mitigation of Self-Preference in LLM Evaluators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>DPO Setup</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Breaking the Mirror: Activation-Based Mitigation of Self-Preference in LLM Evaluators" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Apps Dataset Analysis</span></a></li>
